      "narration": "Aman’Thul reached toward the greatest of the Old Gods and tore Y'Shaarj from the world. The horror was destroyed, but its roots had entered too deeply. Stone, empire, and corruption came away together, and Azeroth's arcane lifeblood surged from the wound. In that instant the Pantheon learned that strength alone might kill the one it sought to save.",
