      "title": "The keepers take command",
      "narration": "Among the titan-forged, the Pantheon raised a smaller company to bear greater power and judgment. These were the keepers. They would command the hosts, answer changing danger with more than brute force, and remain when distant makers had gone. Beneath their direction, the armies entered a world whose every horizon belonged to the enemy.",
