      "guideId": "ordering-of-azeroth-guided-history",
      "title": "Chains beneath the earth",
      "narration": "The surviving Old Gods could not be torn out without opening new wounds. Thus the keepers chose containment. The defeated horrors were bound in prisons beneath Azeroth, near enough to remain a danger, yet held from the sleeping titan's heart. Victory had not erased the corruption. It had made the long guarding of it possible.",
