      "guideId": "ordering-of-azeroth-guided-history",
      "title": "The wound becomes a well",
      "narration": "At the continent's heart, Azeroth still bled light into the open world. The keepers labored around that ruin, raising wards until the torrent quieted and its power found balance. What remained was named the Well of Eternity: not a scar made beautiful, but a scar kept from becoming the death of the world.",
