      "guideId": "ordering-of-azeroth-guided-history",
      "title": "Two forges hold the world",
      "narration": "The work spread from the Well toward two great engines. In the far north, Ulduar held the Forge of Wills. Far to the south stood the Forge of Origination, made both to strengthen the wounded world and, should corruption become absolute, to begin it anew. Between them passed the hidden labor of preservation.",
