      "id": "ordering-story-world-shaped",
      "guideId": "ordering-of-azeroth-guided-history",
      "title": "Mountains rise, and rivers find the sea",
      "narration": "Then began the labor by which victory became a world. Titan-forged hands raised ranges, opened deep places, cut waterways, dredged seas, tended engines, and guarded what had been built. The keepers fostered places where living things could flourish. When they looked across the primary continent they had shaped, they called it Kalimdor, the land beneath eternal starlight.",
      "durationMs": 50000,
