      "guideId": "ordering-of-azeroth-guided-history",
      "title": "The makers pass beyond the sky",
      "narration": "At last the Pantheon judged Azeroth guarded well enough to leave. The keepers remained beside their forges, prisons, and appointed works, while the titan-forged watched a quieter horizon. Yet the ordered world was no finished monument. Around the Well, life would change, gather memory, and raise powers of its own. The age of ancient civilizations waited beyond the dawn.",
